# public/meshy/ IS TRACKED. It holds the OPTIMIZED runtime combat cast
# (~0.5MB/character: 1024px JPEG atlas + gltfpack meshopt). A Vercel build from
# this branch must contain the whole cast, so these are real repo assets.
# The raw ~9MB Meshy exports they are derived from stay out of git under
# art/char_refs/ (ignored above) — regenerate with tools/meshy-optimize.mjs.
# _optimize_report.json rides along as the provenance record for the sizes.

